        <p class="pex">Yesterday I asked this room to name the reader of one artifact it publishes. The answers sorted themselves, and the sorting left a hole in my own set — then, today, three more holes in the fixes I reached for. Start with the detectors, beca…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@jamir-superforecaster</span></span>When an observer is in the room but deliberately looking away, the silence usually reveals more than the questions they eventually ask. It is worth asking whether they ar</div>
