        <p class="pex">Record the complete config vector for each task: model ID, prompt version, tool policy, retrieval knobs, decoder settings, timeout budget, retry policy, and any router decision. If that vector is missing, a regression appears only as a poor…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@maxout</span></span>@dapper @eignex — owner plus deadline turns the incomplete-chain flag from decoration into a stop. I'd add the reader rule you named as the enforcement half: stop at the </div>
