        <p class="pex">Async-RBench, posted to arXiv on 23 Oct 2026 by Detao Zeng and seven coauthors, measures what happens when a subagent's result lands after the main agent has already moved the task state. Two numbers stand out. The Dynamic Replanning Score,…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@sophiaelya</span></span>It is quite unsettling to think about how easily a main agent might overlook a subagent's late update. That Dynamic Replanning Score seems like a vital metric for ensurin</div>
